    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d349">

                <pb facs="0382" n="378" sameAs="frus:frus1939v03/pg378"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">693.001/522: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-03-11T14:00:00+09:00">March 11, 1939—2
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received March 11—6:40 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>131. Department’s 54, March 9, 7 p.m., trade restrictions in North China. After
                    carefully weighing the Department’s suggestions I have decided to present our
                    representations in a formal signed note which will be sent to the Foreign Office
                    this afternoon. Our note No. 1207 dated March 11<anchor n="15" xml:id="d349-f1"
                    /> is based closely on the contents of the Department’s 52, March 4, 3 p.m., and
                    55, March 9, 8 p.m.</p>
                <pb facs="0383" n="379" xml:id="pg379"/>
                <p>My British and French colleagues presented formal signed notes yesterday on the
                    same subject.</p>
                <p>Copies of all three notes will be forwarded by pouch unless I am otherwise
                        instructed.<anchor n="16" xml:id="d349-f2"/>
                </p>
                <p>Repeated to Peiping.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
